  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Added\n- Build check - MustNotDisableUnexpectedWarnings now also checks Directory.Build.props/targets and imported files, and flags WarningsNotAsErrors; new checks MustNotDisableAnalyzers, MustNotSuppressInSource (assembly/module SuppressMessage, GlobalSuppressions.cs) and MustNotDowngradeGlobalConfig (.globalconfig severity downgrades); TreatWarningsAsErrors and analysis properties are now also verified in imported files (#486)\n### Changed\n- Tests - CanCheckOverrideTests now run the production check registrations instead of hand-copied checks (#480)\n- Tests - Private async test helpers return ValueTask instead of Task (#479)\n- IncludeAssets policy overrides and tests for Microsoft.Extensions.Http.Resilience and Microsoft.Extensions.Telemetry.Abstractions (duplicate LoggerMessage generator, #462)\n- Dependencies - Updated Nullable.Extended.Analyzer to 1.19.0\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.Test to 6.4.7.2960\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.Test.Source.Generator to 6.4.7.2960\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Version.Information.Generator to 1.0.142.1766\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Enumeration to 1.2.158.2511\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.CodeAnalysis to 7.2.25.2636\n- SDK - Updated DotNet SDK to 11.0.100-rc.3.26522.148\n- Dependencies - Updated Meziantou.Analyzer to 3.0.322\n- Dependencies - Updated xunit.analyzers to 2.3.0\n- Dependencies - Updated xunit.v3 to 4.0.3\n- Dependencies - Updated Microsoft.Extensions to 10.0.15",
